{"23-25 高考考题精编:P01-Q60":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>2024· 湖南卷 · 化学用语</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">23-25 高考考题精编 · 专题01 化学与STSE 化学用语 · 考点06  化学用语 · 原第60题 · 2024· 湖南卷 · P01-Q60</div><h1>2024· 湖南卷 · 化学用语</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/化学用语</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：原资料定位为“考点06  化学用语”；结合本题题干、选项和考查要求，主归类为“化学用语”。相关类别和小问标签用于跨专题检索。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的结构特点</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>60. （2024· 湖南卷）下列化学用语表述错误的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7:0;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的电子式：<img src=\"chem-asset:c7d19f49a81eb292aa141065c748c753e651301bcee649ec4066fd393c225a51:1;\" style=\"width:108.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 异丙基的结构简式：<img src=\"chem-asset:92cd1d420ce85f2b6d481a4360b7704820d2864783f19825841bd7d71577ef8d:2;\" style=\"width:103.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. NaCl溶液中的水合离子：<img src=\"chem-asset:b09cc259b902b5d35043f034c707a8c716839e5ff897c0b444fd6d05256c40f1:3;\" style=\"width:155.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:25.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">分子中<img src=\"chem-asset:c5efd036929450edf47f527a10025d8e11250d203aeb475d75319e08ea27b760:5;\" style=\"width:13.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键的形成：<img src=\"chem-asset:5e26c9acd3d32b74d59bc67b6cace7babb9a27228103e48ba73c80aadbc824f2:6;\" style=\"width:346.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7:0;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">由Na<sup>+</sup>和OH<sup>-</sup>构成，电子式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:c7e4a5b539fa2ef95a102384312e4ea224cdc7bcbb8364914a2a1edea4ddc7a6:7;\" style=\"width:125.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故A正确；</p><p>B．异丙基的结构简式：<img src=\"chem-asset:e47b0e53733772b6c81de776a7077297739b70dc824840ee9267220ef4446f7a:8;\" style=\"width:91.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故B正确；</p><p>C．Na<sup>+</sup>离子半径比Cl<sup>-</sup>小，水分子电荷情况如图<img src=\"chem-asset:0de497494d38ae916fba69334ac5d90076cc9e21befdc0073277f4c7e18c725c:9;\" style=\"width:65.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，Cl<sup>-</sup>带负电荷，水分子在Cl<sup>-</sup>周围时，呈正电性的H朝向Cl<sup>-</sup>，水分子在Na<sup>+</sup>周围时，呈负电性的O朝向Na<sup>+</sup>，NaCl溶液中的水合离子应为：<img src=\"chem-asset:af4ce0721e4a62084f4d42938db54e2039c0084d6a407920d1257c5aa951eb82:10;\" style=\"width:82.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:b48656c91941bda0035a1d508dfb218ae12016fe600536eba8e273e90c746c37:11;\" style=\"width:76.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故C错误；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652:4;\" style=\"width:25.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">分子中的共价键是由2个氯原子各提供1个未成对电子的3p原子轨道重叠形成的p-pσ键，形成过程为：<img src=\"chem-asset:5e26c9acd3d32b74d59bc67b6cace7babb9a27228103e48ba73c80aadbc824f2:6;\" style=\"width:309.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故D正确；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\23-25 高考考题精编\\专题01 化学与STSE 化学用语（全国通用）-【好题汇编】三年（2023-2025）高考化学真题分类汇编\\专题01 化学与STSE 化学用语（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/23-25%20%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E9%A2%98%E7%B2%BE%E7%BC%96/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9801%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8ESTSE%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%AD%EF%BC%88%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89-%E3%80%90%E5%A5%BD%E9%A2%98%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96%E3%80%91%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%882023-2025%EF%BC%89%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%9C%9F%E9%A2%98%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E6%B1%87%E7%BC%96/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%9801%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8ESTSE%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%AD%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0de497494d38ae916fba69334ac5d90076cc9e21befdc0073277f4c7e18c725c","5e26c9acd3d32b74d59bc67b6cace7babb9a27228103e48ba73c80aadbc824f2","60abb02be9894c8e2674d5fbc394529e2449dfc644810dd41379e46b6c33f652","92cd1d420ce85f2b6d481a4360b7704820d2864783f19825841bd7d71577ef8d","af4ce0721e4a62084f4d42938db54e2039c0084d6a407920d1257c5aa951eb82","b09cc259b902b5d35043f034c707a8c716839e5ff897c0b444fd6d05256c40f1","b48656c91941bda0035a1d508dfb218ae12016fe600536eba8e273e90c746c37","be97c09e4c69b4e95733735cf3e27e782af2f600af6bfc9a01476cbb9c3eceb7","c5efd036929450edf47f527a10025d8e11250d203aeb475d75319e08ea27b760","c7d19f49a81eb292aa141065c748c753e651301bcee649ec4066fd393c225a51","c7e4a5b539fa2ef95a102384312e4ea224cdc7bcbb8364914a2a1edea4ddc7a6","e47b0e53733772b6c81de776a7077297739b70dc824840ee9267220ef4446f7a"],"sourceSha256":"f7231db22f78e703829e171c9a103c5c9b8c335787016fb0e42b728d46c0dbfa"}}